(7242644, 1122303, 58634, '<td valign="top">I do like the effect here as well. As soon as I saw it I knew it was your because I remember the last picture of yours that I really liked, and I''m pretty sure this is the same model. <br/> <br/>Anyway, beautiful bokeh effect on the background and lovely movement throughout. This is a special image.</td>', 'I do like the effect here as well. As soon as I saw it I knew it was your because I remember the last picture of yours that I really liked, and I''m pretty sure this is the same model.  Anyway, beautiful bokeh effect on the background and lovely movement throughout. This is a special image.', '2014-07-20 21:41:22.000000', NULL, 0),
