(7242996, 1122311, 16106, '<td valign="top">You may consider it a picture of you goofy dog, but there is a solid reason this deserved blue. The tones, the powerfull leading lines, the hint of sunset in the reflections, the perfect blur of the road, but mostly it is the pure joy radiating off the goofy dog and it was one of the few entries that is almost entirely about the wind.</td>', 'You may consider it a picture of you goofy dog, but there is a solid reason this deserved blue. The tones, the powerfull leading lines, the hint of sunset in the reflections, the perfect blur of the road, but mostly it is the pure joy radiating off the goofy dog and it was one of the few entries that is almost entirely about the wind.', '2014-07-21 20:49:12.000000', NULL, 0),
